    {
      "entry_id": "quantisation-end",
      "subject": "Quantisation at the end of the stack only (exact model)",
      "status": "calibrated",
      "formula": "acc_0 = 1 (empty stack); acc_i = acc_(i-1) + (c_i - acc_(i-1)) * alpha with alpha = float32(1/3) in float64 arithmetic; an L channel takes the mean of the colour's three components. Quantiser Q: RGB16/L16 round(x*65535), RGB8/L8 round(x*255), RGB16F/L16F nearest half, RGB32F/L32F nearest float32, sRGB8 round(255*encode(x)) with encode/decode IEC 61966-2-1 (blending on linear values). End model: acc stays unquantised; Q is applied once to the final acc.",
